        "text": "=Please generate a warm and professional welcome email for a new client from Mubrix Technology (an agency providing advanced Tech and Agentic AI solutions).\n\nSender Details:\n- Agency Name: Mubrix Technology\n- Owner Name: Muhammad Mubashir Shafique\n\nClient Details:\n- Name: {{ $json['Name '] }}\n- Company/Industry: {{ $json['Company Name '] }}\n- Required Service: {{ $json['Required Service '] }}\n- Preferred Start Date: {{ $json['Starting Date '] }}\n\nGuidelines:\n- Tone: Professional, welcoming, and friendly.\n- Subject line must be simple, clean, and welcoming (e.g., \"Welcome to Mubrix Technology!\" or \"Welcome to Mubrix Technology, {{ $json['Name '] }}!\").\n- Express excitement about collaborating and helping their business grow with our solutions.\n- Acknowledge their preferred start date and state that our team will reach out shortly with the next steps.\n- Mention that they will receive a separate email containing the Terms of Service agreement.\n- Politely inform them not to reply to this automated email.\n- Keep the format clean with separate Subject and Body sections.",
        "options": {}
